  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You knock the feet from under creatures with your staff.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Weapon Focus (quarterstaff), flurry of blows class feature, ki strike class feature, 1st mythic tier.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can expend one use of your mythic power or one point from your ki pool as a full-round action to imbue any quarterstaff you touch with the ki focus weapon property for 1 hour. This property functions only in your hands. When you use this quarterstaff to perform a flurry of blows, you add one-half your mythic tier on combat maneuver checks made to disarm or sunder.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-g-m-feats#toc88\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
